<title>JORDAN: Jordan overnight rates rise to 7.66 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan overnight rates rise to 7.66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 7.66 percent on Tuesday from 6.99 percent on Monday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
